```suggestion
        if isinstance(value, float):
            if equal_valued((v:=2*value), (i:=int(v))):
                return Rational(i, 2)
        return value
```
`equal_valued` can be imported from sympy.core.numbers. Should this be passing if someone passes 3/3?

```suggestion
                return Integer(int(value))
```

```suggestion
from sympy.core.numbers import (Float, I, Integer, pi, Rational, equal_valued)
```

```suggestion
    elif isinstance(value, (float, Float)):
        if isinstance(value, float) and value.is_integer():
            return Integer(int(value))
        elif (equal_valued((v:=2*value), (i:=int(v)))):
            return Rational(i, 2)
    elif isinstance(value, Integer):
        return value
    elif isinstance(value, Rational) and value.q == 2:
        return value
```

