It looks like `mpmath` has a bunch of those functions e.g. factorial, erfc, li, ff, sinc, ...

Maybe the rewrites should be put into groups in the CodePrinter class so that subclasses can choose which groups to use e.g.:
```python
class CodePrinter:
    _basic_rewrites = {
        'sinc': 'sin',
        ...
    }
    _reciprocal_trig_rewrites = {
        'sec': 'cos',
        ...
    }

class NumPyPrinter(CodePrinter):
    _rewrites = {
        **CodePrinter._basic_rewrites,
        **CodePrinter._reciprocal_trig_rewrites,
    }
```

